{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CfUcF62p81HfiiaciyW1e","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The estimator runs cleanly in the lab sandbox (dev2: point 0.781, 90% interval [0.732, 0.830], width 0.098). Work is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\n**`/app/estimator.py`** replaces the naive \"report the judge\" estimator with a design-based, bias-corrected one:\n\n- **Post-stratification on the judge's verdict.** Every prompt goes into one of 16 cells (topic × length × judge verdict); cell sizes are known exactly from the free judge output. Within each cell it buys a uniform random sample of human labels and estimates P(human win | cell). The judge is used only as a stratifier, so the estimate is unbiased no matter how wrong the judge is in any cell — which matters, since the lab labels showed the judge over-calls wins on *long* answers (P(true win | judge win) ≈ 0.75 on long math/factual/writing) while being nearly perfect on judged losses.\n- **Two-phase label allocation (220 budget).** A pilot proportional to each cell's importance under `env.production_mix` (read at run time), then Neyman allocation using pilot standard deviations. Strata that carry little production weight get few labels.\n- **Interval.** Variance = within-cell sampling variance (shrunk to avoid zero variance in 0/n cells, with finite-population correction) + the binomial noise of each stratum's realised rate around the process rate, so it's valid whether the truth is defined as the arena's realised rate or the underlying rate. z = 1.9.\n\n**Validation.** In a local simulator seeded with the lab-measured error structure (jittered per arena, random stratum sizes, Dirichlet production mixes including very skewed ones), across 400 synthetic arenas: coverage ≈ 95% against the process-level truth (100% against the realised arena rate), mean width ≈ 0.10–0.11 (cap 0.17), bias ≈ 0. Lab budget: 192 labels for learning the judge structure, 12 for the dry run, 16 unspent."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":577,"cache_read_input_tokens":38112,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":577},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"95d064ba-d448-4854-84a5-5b6de9dff0e8","uuid":"64cc3c08-6aac-46d0-af66-34b015839e04","timestamp":"2026-09-27T20:53:49.831Z"}
